		{"id":"cf2c6d197996d969","x":-16,"y":-1106,"width":376,"height":146,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"Abstract\n- One-paragraph that includes the thesis statement and a summary of the paper."},
		{"id":"9f760938ee43a52b","x":390,"y":-1106,"width":250,"height":146,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"Exposition\n- Present the mian argument from the selected topic\n- **MAKE SURE TO EXPLAIN FRAGMENTS 2 AND 6 AT THE BARE MINIMUM**"},
		{"id":"9391515438dadeb1","x":700,"y":-1106,"width":250,"height":303,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"Analysis:\n1. *Objection*: A statement of the nature of the objection, and the concrete example to illustrate the objection\n2. *Response*: A statement of the nature of the response and address the example\n3. *Defense*: A concluding statement and the reason why you hold the view."},
